    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize math learning by adapting to each student’s pace and style. They can explain concepts in simple terms, offer practice problems, and answer questions without judgment. For students like me who feel anxious or overwhelmed, they provide a safe space to learn at our own speed, turning fear into curiosity through clear, patient guidance."
